    <heading>Example 4</heading>
    <div class="description-paragraph">A series of polyethylene and polypropylene/polyethylene laminates were made with a thickness of about 1 mil. As shown in Table 4, the puncture strength increases with the angle of bias and the use of polyproplyene as one of the plies.</div>
